   $q$Listen. Goat, Sheep, and Cow found a heavy log blocking the path to the green field. Goat pushed the log alone, but it did not move. Sheep pushed alone, and it still did not move. Then all three friends pushed hard at the same time, and the log rolled away. They ran into the field and ate fresh grass all afternoon. What is the lesson of this story? Tap the answer.$q$, $q$[{"text":"Tell the truth","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"Tell the truth"}},{"text":"Work as a team","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"Work as a team"}},{"text":"Be patient","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"Be patient"}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Work as a team$q$, $q$One animal alone could not move the log, but all three pushing at once rolled it away. The lesson is work as a team.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
