   $q$Listen. Long ago on an island, a girl named Lani wanted to watch the sunrise from the top of a hill. She packed a banana and started up the rocky path before the sky was light. Halfway up, a cold rain began, so Lani waited under a big tree. When the rain stopped, she climbed to the top and saw a bright rainbow over the sea. What did Lani see at the end of the story? Tap the picture.$q$, $q$[{"text":"banana","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"banana","count":1}},{"text":"rainbow","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"rainbow","count":1}},{"text":"tree","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"tree","count":1}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$rainbow$q$, $q$First, Lani packed a banana. Next, Lani waited under a tree in the rain. At the end, Lani saw a rainbow over the sea.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
