   $q$Listen. Lin and Grandpa Ming walked to the market on a gray, cloudy morning to buy fruit. Halfway there, the wind blew and the rain began to pour down. Lin had forgotten an umbrella, but Grandpa opened a big one for both of them. At the market, they bought some sweet pears and then walked slowly home together, dry and smiling. What went wrong on the way to the market? Tap the picture.$q$, $q$[{"text":"sun","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"sun","count":1}},{"text":"pears","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"pear","count":1}},{"text":"rain","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"rain","count":1}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$rain$q$, $q$On the way to the market, the rain began to pour. Grandpa fixed the problem with a big umbrella, and they stayed dry.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
