   $q$Listen. A crab named Kai lived in a shell that had grown too small. First, Kai tried a round shell, but it was too big and heavy. Next, Kai crawled into an old cup on the sand, but it felt cold and slippery. Then Kai peeked inside a bucket, but it was full of water. At last, Kai found a shell that fit just right and settled in for a nap. Where did Kai settle in at the end? Tap the picture.$q$, $q$[{"text":"shell","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"shell","count":1}},{"text":"bucket","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"bucket","count":1}},{"text":"cup","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"cup","count":1}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$shell$q$, $q$Kai tried a big shell, a cup, and a bucket. At the end, Kai found a shell that fit just right and took a nap.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
