   $q$Listen. On a hot, dry plain, the animals were thirsty because their pond had dried up. First, Elephant dug in the dirt with its strong feet, but found no water. Next, Monkey climbed a tall tree to look for clouds. Then a big gray cloud rolled in, and rain poured down. By the end of the day, the pond was full, and every animal took a long, cool drink. What filled the pond at the end? Tap the picture.$q$, $q$[{"text":"milk","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"milk","count":1}},{"text":"rain","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"rain","count":1}},{"text":"snow","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"snow","count":1}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$rain$q$, $q$Digging did not work. Then a cloud rolled in and rain poured down. The rain filled the pond, and the animals drank.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
