   $q$Listen. Little Goat was afraid of the dark barn late at night. Every creak and hoot made Little Goat jump. Grandma Goat lit a small lamp and sat beside the bed of hay. She told a story about the bright stars that watch over the farm. By the end of the story, Little Goat yawned and fell asleep with a smile. How did Little Goat feel at the beginning of the story? Tap the picture.$q$, $q$[{"text":"happy","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"face_happy","count":1}},{"text":"mad","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"face_mad","count":1}},{"text":"scared","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"face_scared","count":1}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$scared$q$, $q$At the beginning, Little Goat was afraid of the dark barn and jumped at every sound. That is scared. At the end, Little Goat smiled.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
