   $q$Listen. Ant, Bee, and Worm all lived in one garden. They argued about whose job mattered most, and each one went off alone. Ant stopped digging little tunnels, Bee stopped visiting the flowers, and Worm stopped making the dirt rich. Soon the plants drooped and the flowers faded. When all three friends went back to their jobs, the garden grew green again. What is the lesson of this story? Tap the answer.$q$, $q$[{"text":"Be patient","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"Be patient"}},{"text":"Work as a team","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"Work as a team"}},{"text":"Tell the truth","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"Tell the truth"}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Work as a team$q$, $q$The garden needed all three jobs. When they each went off alone, it drooped. When all three worked again, it grew green. The lesson is work as a team.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
